{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.MassFormulaCategorical","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.MassFormulaCategorical","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic","lean:module:QOU.HeckeAlgebra.Common"],"declarations":7,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.MassFormulaCategorical.categoricalMassMeV_nonneg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.MassFormulaCategorical.categoricalMassMeV_nonneg","kind":"theorem","line":105,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/MassFormulaCategorical.lean#L105-L111","doc":"**MeV mass is non-negative**. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.MassFormulaCategorical.categoricalMassMeV","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.MassFormulaCategorical.categoricalMassMeV","kind":"def","line":99,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/MassFormulaCategorical.lean#L99-L103","doc":"**Mass conversion cat-units → MeV**: multiply by the CODATA\nelectron-mass scale.  Implements\n`M(K)_MeV := M(K)_cat · M_E_MEV_CODATA`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.MassFormulaCategorical.categoricalMass_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.MassFormulaCategorical.categoricalMass_pos","kind":"theorem","line":86,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/MassFormulaCategorical.lean#L86-L97","doc":"**Mass is strictly positive** when ρ > 0, m_e > 0, and the\nMarkov trace is non-zero. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.MassFormulaCategorical.categoricalMass_nonneg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.MassFormulaCategorical.categoricalMass_nonneg","kind":"theorem","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/MassFormulaCategorical.lean#L74-L84","doc":"**Mass is non-negative** (multiplicity, electron mass, and\n`|tr_M|` are all non-negative). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.MassFormulaCategorical.categoricalMass","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.MassFormulaCategorical.categoricalMass","kind":"def","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/MassFormulaCategorical.lean#L67-L72","doc":"**Categorical mass formula**: `M(T_w) = ρ · m_e · |tr_M(T_w)|`\nin cat units.  At this abstraction level, `T_w : HeckeElement n`,\n`ρ : ℕ`, and `m_e : ℝ` (the cat-unit electron mass, distinct\nfrom the MeV-scale one). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.MassFormulaCategorical.m_e_MeV_codata_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.MassFormulaCategorical.m_e_MeV_codata_pos","kind":"theorem","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/MassFormulaCategorical.lean#L62-L65","doc":"The CODATA electron-mass scale is positive. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.MassFormulaCategorical.m_e_MeV_codata","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.MassFormulaCategorical.m_e_MeV_codata","kind":"def","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/MassFormulaCategorical.lean#L58-L60","doc":"The CODATA electron-mass scale in MeV: `m_e = 0.51099895069`.\nThe only CAL input in the QOU mass-prediction chain. ","signatureChunk":0}]}